cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "evalpower: does this eval have enough data to support its verdict?"
abstract: >-
  Checks whether a pass/fail eval result set has enough data to support the
  verdict it printed. Reports Wilson score and bootstrap percentile
  intervals per dimension, three way PASS/FAIL/INDETERMINATE verdicts,
  Benjamini-Hochberg adjustment for testing several dimensions against the
  same threshold at once, and the closed form sample size that would resolve
  an indeterminate dimension.
type: software
version: "0.1.0"
date-released: "2026-09-07"
license: MIT
